THEOREM (conjectured, computationally verified to very high confidence):
For any tournament T and any cycle C* with deg(I(Omega\C*))=deg(I(Omega-N[C*]))+1,
the polynomial I(Omega-N[C*],x) interlaces I(Omega\C*,x).

This, combined with Turán-ULC for the base case and Lemma A (existence),
gives a complete inductive proof of TRRT via Hermite-Biehler.
